# The curve figures and the block figure are evidence and they are committed in docs/, so they are
# excepted from the plot rule. They are the only figures in the repository: curves.py and
# block_sweep.py write them there and nowhere else. Keep this last, because the last matching rule
# wins.
!docs/curves_*.png
!docs/block_*.png
